DTSTAMP:20260923T212937Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Court Closure on September 29\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 23\, 2026\nThe Clerk’s Office for the 
 U.S. District Court for the District of Maine will be closed on September 
 29\, 2026\, for a full-day staff training.\nDesignated staff will be avail
 able to address urgent matters and will monitor the Joint ECF Inbox throug
 hout the day.\nhttps://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/court-closure-september-2
 9-2026
URL:https://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/court-closure-september-29-2026
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
